name: Report choices survive restart without exporting or restoring approval
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Session choices | initial-report
keys: j j j c e C-u
paste-file: @ART/report-path.txt
keys: Enter
keys: S
require-live-snap: 25 Saved for this target | saved-choices
expect: json · open
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART saved
ask: Does saving format, filter and destination preserve the operator draft and clearly avoid export, approval or investigation work?
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 Saved for this target | report-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 Saved for this target | report-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 Saved for this target | report-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.5
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.5
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: report-controls-40x12
expect: save choices
expect-not: kz> End
ask: Are the selected format/destination and persistence controls reachable at all six terminal sizes?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Saved for this target | restored-report
expect: json · open
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restored
ask: Does no-color restart restore the same choices while retaining an honest empty investigation and no automatic export?
keys: s
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | explicit-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-restart-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART damage
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | damaged-restart
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Saved choices unavailable | damaged-preferences
expect: Current choices
expect: are shown.
keys: j j j c e C-u
paste-file: @ART/report-path.txt
keys: Enter
keys: s
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | export-with-damaged-choices
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART damaged-export
keys: S
require-live-snap: 25 Saved for this target | explicit-choice-repair
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART repaired
ask: Does damaged preference recovery retain current choices, keep malformed bytes through export, and require explicit S to replace them without restoring approvals or starting work?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-final-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
